    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 58,
        "text": "Hi, Lisa. How's your project on campus recycling going?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "e37b3572f52cb2be83ae0a9b17fde379353df8340dfd7ce59d6df43b32fc61a8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 62,
        "sourceEnd": 209,
        "text": "Oh, hi, Tom. It's going okay, but I'm a bit stuck. I'm trying to find information about the new recycling bins, but I can't find the exact numbers.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "78446be4d9cec35c0ec2f32821daa8538b37e2d8d1a30c97d0aaad475dd0896b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 213,
        "sourceEnd": 284,
        "text": "I think the student union website has a report. Have you checked there?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "44b7a54ef91417b784f4e68abae0ebc3b4ec60d7691d2c757a6a6629ed88e481",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 288,
        "sourceEnd": 414,
        "text": "Yes, I looked, but it's not very clear. It says the number of bins was increased, but it doesn't say by how much. Do you know?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f1335dc9094afd4c9df23ccaa8ea5b29b228877d220080acce80efcaa002657e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 418,
        "sourceEnd": 560,
        "text": "Actually, I read somewhere that they added twenty new bins this year. But I'm not sure if that's just for the library or for the whole campus.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "b36c2dac5c67046184a465150f31649849d1e25390a8fe30cc33d39afab204ec",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 564,
        "sourceEnd": 645,
        "text": "Hmm. Maybe I should ask at the student union office. They might have the details.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "579633a08e92cb3c92ab2f5889c0da5ff51346656bca68abc34031a05f32d637",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 649,
        "sourceEnd": 741,
        "text": "That's a good idea. By the way, are you going to the library workshop on reading strategies?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "5dfb030258587f5abe264deaac6e3a9a1e0ac4acaa58490d53fe9593c119c040",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 745,
        "sourceEnd": 785,
        "text": "I didn't know there was one. When is it?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "60be524eb1e3660c6079eb5ba668b7fc035f4b4ec8adf70aa2b9809b6441bfd8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 789,
        "sourceEnd": 919,
        "text": "It's next Wednesday, at 2 p.m. The topic is 'Finding Key Information Quickly'. I went to one last month, and it was really useful.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "17f7ac6e2c919646efb823b9dc7682b09998c911a81e638d8542619c9cefcb11",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 923,
        "sourceEnd": 946,
        "text": "Oh, what did you learn?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "4660119c18a06af057255b584de81183fb992be2c866dce50e3edcad16c97426",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 950,
        "sourceEnd": 1173,
        "text": "Well, one thing was about reading the first and last sentences of paragraphs. The tutor said that the main idea is often there. Also, we practised looking for words like 'however' and 'therefore' to understand the argument.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "7352a66c83e1a76a4df4ff14e3014bd233b435fcc42a79fb0c58362c434f45d1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1177,
        "sourceEnd": 1281,
        "text": "That sounds helpful. I'll try to go. But I have a lecture at 2 p.m. on Wednesday. Is there another time?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "dd9b74b9bb921844dfddce3aed50daf636420c23fca8acbf9be13d4fb8c0fb01",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1285,
        "sourceEnd": 1414,
        "text": "Let me think... I think there's also a session on Thursday at 10 a.m. But I'm not sure. You should check the library noticeboard.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "3230eab4094354ad066d97932132170993e98e9e7c39ad0fc476626fb1ddaf97",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1418,
        "sourceEnd": 1450,
        "text": "Okay, I'll do that. Thanks, Tom.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9587cd174992204870539c747bd1b4695538103976fd6b4b1fc6b9b7f2dfc036",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1454,
        "sourceEnd": 1494,
        "text": "No problem. Good luck with your project!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "2dee053978170e41e4d329136b41f23ef52160b2c5d9b1c3259392a67efc33b5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
